  m_text: "Swipe each email to sort it.\n\n\u25C0  Swipe <b>LEFT</b> \u2192 <color=#FF6B6B><b>SCAM</b></color>\nSwipe
    <b>RIGHT</b> \u2192 <color=#4ECDC4><b>SAFE</b></color>  \u25B6\n\nCorrect \u2192
    fish joins the bucket!\nWrong \u2192 pufferfish spikes it.\n<b>5 cracks</b> and
    the bucket breaks."
